1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
What’s new in Island Time 1.24.0, shown with mock game data.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,000
The start page now fits on one screen.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,500
Each card has Continue, Saves, and three buttons to start a new game: 1 week, 1 month or 1 year.

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:18,000
Islanders play a week, a month, or a year in story mode.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,500
Visitors play a week’s visit, a month as a weekend regular, or a whole year.

6
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:27,000
A year as a weekend regular is four months: summer, fall, winter and spring.

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,500
Your money, island friends and reputation carry from month to month.

8
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:36,000
ℹ️ About explains every way to play, the difficulty levels, and how to install the game.

9
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,500
What’s new and the rebuilt video tutorial are in there too.

10
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:46,000
Play free in your browser at krazow.github.io/islandtime

